{%- comment -%}
  NURVA PERFORMANCE — clean home page section.

  Online Store -> Themes -> Edit code -> Sections -> Add a new section,
  name it  nurva-home  (Shopify adds the .liquid), paste this in, Save.
  Then Customize -> Add section -> Nurva home, and pick your product there.

  One real purchase block (Buy 1 Get 1 Free) instead of 1/3/6-pack pricing
  tiers, so the homepage matches your actual offer and the product page.
  Styles are scoped under .nurva and cannot affect the rest of your theme.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign bp = section.settings.product -%}
{%- assign bpv = bp.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}

